Hi {Owner},

I build websites for yoga and pilates studios around {City}. {Business Name} has a beautiful room and a loyal community on its social pages, but no site that tells a beginner which class to try and what it costs.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a class style and heat guide, a reformer intro path, studio etiquette for first-timers, a teacher training page and the schedule, with marked placeholders where your photos would go. It hands bookings to the system you already use:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and workshop updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone after the morning classes?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
